	(text_box "10 MHz sine from a GPSDO (0.3 V peak or more), or any 0.5 to 3.3 V square wave to 80 MHz. 50 Ω if the shunt is in. AC coupled into a TLV3501 comparator on the ADC's low-noise 3.3 V: +IN biased to mid-rail through 10 kΩ, -IN at mid-rail, 6 mV of\nhysteresis inside, 4.5 ns. The FPGA's PLL locks to it (8 MHz minimum)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 194.31 0)
		(size 175.26 6.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
