		)
		(uuid "168ba008-734c-cda2-3b7f-dc7daf56032c")
	)
	(text_box "JTAG header (hand soldered): the same four signals the FT2232H drives through the USB sheet. TCK pulled down, TMS/TDI/TDO pulled up (Lattice checklist). These four local\nlabels and the SDRAM bus members are the only labels on this sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 544.83 347.98 0)
